      "excerpt": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2008-2021 Nissan Frontier Crew Cab\nONLY For Without Rockford Fosgate Audio System.\nOnly For Dual Posts On Drivers Floor.\nfor Carpet Flooring\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2008-2021 Nissan Frontier Crew Cab. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back. These mats are not for vehicles with the optional Rockford Fosgate Audio System and vinyl floors. Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor ones.\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, ensuring 100% safety even in extreme hot weather. The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible in even the harshest of cold weather.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping. The mats are available for children and the elderly.\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle."
